  "proof_boundary": "This gate proves the all-multiplicity theta-primitive contact coordinate and an exact positive-time modular-reflection, theta-tail, Laguerre-Polya first-loss family realizing every real field. It does not reproduce the discrete Jacobi-theta summand roster, bound the actual Xi field, prove a degree-uniform Jensen remainder, exclude an Xi collision, prove Lambda<=0, RH, or a prize-level conclusion.",
  "published_input": {
    "title": "Using integrals of squares of certain real-valued special functions to prove that K_(iz)(a) has only real zeros",
    "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.2996",
    "use": "K_(iz)(a) has only real zeros for a>0."
  },
  "rows": [
    {
      "certificate": "Fourier-field, theta-primitive, theta-probability, and theta-tail guards are loaded.",
      "claim": "Four parent contracts are current and hash-pinned.",
      "id": "mpc_01_sources",
      "proof_boundary": "No parent conclusion is strengthened.",
      "readiness": "proved",
      "role": "source chain"
    },
    {
      "certificate": "With A_t=D_t[C_t]=8H_t-1/2, exact multiplicity m at c means A_t(c)=-1/2, A_t^(j)(c)=0 for 1<=j<m, and A_t^(m)(c)!=0.",
      "claim": "Every multiplicity contact transfers exactly to the endpoint-subtracted theta primitive.",
      "id": "mpc_02_theta_coordinate",
      "proof_boundary": "This is an exact coordinate change, not a contact exclusion.",
      "readiness": "proved",
      "role": "theta coordinate"
    },
    {
      "certificate": "B_c=A_t^(m+1)(c)/((m+1)A_t^(m)(c)) and ell=(2cB_c-m)/4.",
      "claim": "The regular field is the adjacent theta-primitive jet ratio.",
      "id": "mpc_03_field",
      "proof_boundary": "The ratio remains signed.",
      "readiness": "proved",
      "role": "regular field"
    },
    {
      "certificate": "The audited all-j formula differentiates D_t=-4t^2D_x^2+4txD_x+(2t-1-x^2).",
      "claim": "Every theta contact equation is an explicit finite recurrence in C_t jets.",
      "id": "mpc_04_operator_jets",
      "proof_boundary": "No sign follows from the recurrence alone.",
      "readiness": "proved",
      "role": "operator recurrence"
    },
    {
      "certificate": "At contact, sum_n A_(n,t)=-1/2 and sum_n A_(n,t)^(j)=0 for 1<=j<m.",
      "claim": "The exact arithmetic theta decomposition enters only through coupled infinite sums of these jets.",
      "id": "mpc_05_summands",
      "proof_boundary": "Finite or termwise positivity is forbidden by the parent spectral gate.",
      "readiness": "guard_validated",
      "role": "infinite cancellation"
    },
    {
      "certificate": "z_a(u)=2 exp(-a cosh(4u))/K_0(a) is even, positive, uniformly strongly log-concave, and has double-exponential tails.",
      "claim": "A P\u00f3lya-Bessel density supplies a smooth theta-style tail.",
      "id": "mpc_06_bessel_density",
      "proof_boundary": "This is not the discrete Xi theta series.",
      "readiness": "proved",
      "role": "tail model"
    },
    {
      "certificate": "G_a(x)=K_(ix/4)(a)/K_0(a); the published square-integral theorem proves K_(iz)(a) has only real zeros for a>0.",
      "claim": "Its characteristic transform belongs to the Laguerre-Polya class.",
      "id": "mpc_07_bessel_transform",
      "proof_boundary": "Published input is cited; it does not concern Xi.",
      "readiness": "proved",
      "role": "published LP input"
    },
    {
      "certificate": "Integration by parts gives E[Z V'(Z)]=1 and z sinh(4z)>=4z^2, hence E[Z^2]<=1/(16a) and G_a(c)>=1-c^2/(32a)>0 when a>c^2/32.",
      "claim": "The Bessel factor can be kept nonzero at the prescribed contact.",
